{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "你今晚有安排了是吧  (You Have Plans Tonight, Right?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Instead of Chun Yuqiao, Bu Xiaogu walks into a noisy surprise birthday party thrown by her wealthy young admirer—just as Yuqiao phones to discuss work before heading to Hong Kong to court sponsors over foosball. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "惊喜！谢谢大家给我过生日，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "商量一下工作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你这在哪儿啊？听起来很热闹啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你今晚有安排了是吧？那你先轻松一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没有安排，我现在过去找你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以在说服广告商支持改版这个事儿上，孙总有想法了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是专业的，请指点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我让先，侯总请。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "按国际大赛规则，怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "侯总好球。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拜拜。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "惊喜！谢谢大家给我过生日，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a surprise! Thank you everyone for celebrating my birthday!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "商量一下工作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go over a work matter.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你这在哪儿啊？听起来很热闹啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are you right now? It sounds very lively over there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你今晚有安排了是吧？那你先轻松一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You already have plans tonight, right? Go ahead and relax first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没有安排，我现在过去找你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't have plans — I'll head over to find you right now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以在说服广告商支持改版这个事儿上，孙总有想法了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So when it comes to persuading advertisers to back the revamp, you have an idea in mind?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是专业的，请指点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're the specialist in advertising — lead the way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我让先，侯总请。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll yield the first serve — after you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "按国际大赛规则，怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Shall we play by international tournament rules?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "侯总好球。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nice shot.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拜拜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bye now.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "惊喜！谢谢大家给我过生日，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
